{"id":"vod_bf_44446","vodId":"44446","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么第四季","name_cn":"在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么第四季","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/1c921046f4c017f35904150d100fd29b.jpg"},"summary":"恶梦没有结束，绝望诱使毁灭，灾厄招来祸端——与“破坏者”扎格纳特塔塔开中，贝尔和琉坠入深渊。到达之处是所有冒险者都畏惧的迷宫深处——深层。两人伤痕累累，孤立无援，灾厄的威胁就在眼前。迷宫决死之行中，被五年前的悔恨折磨的琉回忆起来往昔的伙伴。另一边，贝尔消失的队伍前出现了双头龙——阿非斯·贝那。破坏的化身能喷射出毁灭一切的炎流。在失去希望和光明的迷宫中，冒险者们迎来的是终结还是……这是少年和妖精在死境中求生，充满残酷的“眷族故事”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:20:49","episodeCount":22,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/zaidixiachengxunqiuxiehoushifougaocuoliaoshimedisiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":